@node MAIN "MintVID Guide"
                              MintVID Guide
                              -------------

@{b}MintVID 1.4.0@{ub} - a codec-agnostic video player for accelerated 68k
AmigaOS hardware, from 68030-class ECS/AGA systems up to PiStorm/RTG
machines.

